<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A1" title="In Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A </span>Detailed Audit of the Perception Test for Visual Entity Tracking</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Proof of Theorem 1</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Quantitative Analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Hallucination</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Molmo2-SGCoT</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Training</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
