<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" title="Video Benchmarks for Spatiotemporal Perception ‣ 6 Related Work ‣ Can Vision-Language Models Solve the Shell Game?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§6</span></a>.
</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
