<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F13.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="382.81" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 382.81" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,382.81) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.74 L 0 376.07 C 0 379.79 3.02 382.81 6.74 382.81 L 543.26 382.81 C 546.98 382.81 550 379.79 550 376.07 L 550 6.74 C 550 3.02 546.98 0 543.26 0 L 6.74 0 C 3.02 0 0 3.02 0 6.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFAFA;" fill="#FFFAFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 6.74 L 0.83 361.09 L 549.17 361.09 L 549.17 6.74 C 549.17 3.47 546.53 0.83 543.26 0.83 L 6.74 0.83 C 3.47 0.83 0.83 3.47 0.83 6.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 368.54)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="445.97"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F13.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.23em;">
<span id="A3.F13.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 21.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.06em;--ltx-fo-height:23.27em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="324.71" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 322.02)" width="512.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F13.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.06em;">
<span id="A3.F13.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Which cup contains the ball at the end of the video? 
<br class="ltx_break">(A) Left 
<br class="ltx_break">(B) Middle 
<br class="ltx_break">(C) Right 
<br class="ltx_break">Output your final answer (A, B, or C) in the format: <math id="A3.F13.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A3.F13.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At the end of the video, all three cups are back in their original positions, and there is no visible ball. However, based on the sequence:</span></span>
<span id="A3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At 0:02, the ball appears under the rightmost cup.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At 0:04, the rightmost cup moves slightly but still covers the ball.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">From 0:06 onwards, the cups shuffle around, but by 0:12, they return to their initial positions.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A3.F13.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Since the ball was hidden under the rightmost cup at 0:02 and <span id="A3.F13.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">no one moved it afterward (the cups just shuffled)</span>, it should still be under the rightmost cup when they return to their positions. Therefore, the ball is under the right cup at the end. <math id="A3.F13.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F13.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="371.54" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 371.54" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,371.54) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.74 L 0 364.81 C 0 368.53 3.02 371.54 6.74 371.54 L 543.26 371.54 C 546.98 371.54 550 368.53 550 364.81 L 550 6.74 C 550 3.02 546.98 0 543.26 0 L 6.74 0 C 3.02 0 0 3.02 0 6.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFAFA;" fill="#FFFAFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 6.74 L 0.83 352.4 L 549.17 352.4 L 549.17 6.74 C 549.17 3.47 546.53 0.83 543.26 0.83 L 6.74 0.83 C 3.47 0.83 0.83 3.47 0.83 6.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 357.17)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="445.97"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F13.pic2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.23em;">
<span id="A3.F13.pic2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Kimi-K2.5</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 18.6)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.06em;--ltx-fo-height:22.84em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="316.03" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 316.03)" width="512.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F13.pic2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.06em;">
<span id="A3.F13.pic2.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Which cup contains the ball at the end of the video? 
<br class="ltx_break">(A) Left 
<br class="ltx_break">(B) Middle 
<br class="ltx_break">(C) Right 
<br class="ltx_break">Output your final answer (A, B, or C) in the format: <math id="A3.F13.pic2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A3.F13.pic2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Looking at the video sequence:</span></span>
<span id="A3.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A3.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A3.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At [00:00:00.500], the middle cup is lifted, revealing a red ball underneath.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A3.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At [00:00:01.500], the middle cup is placed back down, covering the ball.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A3.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">The cups then move around in various patterns.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<span id="A3.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At [00:00:12.100], the cups return to their original positions (left, middle, right).</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A3.F13.pic2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Since the ball was placed under the middle cup at [00:00:01.500], and that cup is back in the center position at the end of the video, <span id="A3.F13.pic2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">the ball remains under the middle cup</span>. <math id="A3.F13.pic2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F13.pic3" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="340.26" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 340.26" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,340.26) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.74 L 0 333.52 C 0 337.24 3.02 340.26 6.74 340.26 L 543.26 340.26 C 546.98 340.26 550 337.24 550 333.52 L 550 6.74 C 550 3.02 546.98 0 543.26 0 L 6.74 0 C 3.02 0 0 3.02 0 6.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFAFA;" fill="#FFFAFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 6.74 L 0.83 321.11 L 549.17 321.11 L 549.17 6.74 C 549.17 3.47 546.53 0.83 543.26 0.83 L 6.74 0.83 C 3.47 0.83 0.83 3.47 0.83 6.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 325.88)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="445.97"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F13.pic3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.23em;">
<span id="A3.F13.pic3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Doubao-Seed-1.8</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 21.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.06em;--ltx-fo-height:20.38em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="284.74" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 282.05)" width="512.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F13.pic3.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.06em;">
<span id="A3.F13.pic3.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Which cup contains the ball at the end of the video? 
<br class="ltx_break">(A) Left 
<br class="ltx_break">(B) Middle 
<br class="ltx_break">(C) Right 
<br class="ltx_break">Output your final answer (A, B, or C) in the format: <math id="A3.F13.pic3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A3.F13.pic3.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic3.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">To determine which cup contains the ball, observe the video sequence:</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A3.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At the start, the right cup is lifted, revealing the red ball underneath (timestamps ~0.2–0.8 seconds).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">After the right cup is placed back, the cups move around, </span><span id="A3.I3.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">but the ball remains under the right cup through the movements</span><span id="A3.I3.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (as the initial placement and subsequent cup movements confirm the ball’s position relative to the right cup).</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A3.F13.pic3.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F13.pic3.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thus, the cup containing the ball at the end is the right one. <math id="A3.F13.pic3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 13: </span>Examples of model responses on VET-Bench. Errors are highlighted in <span id="A3.F13.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Hallucination</h2>

<figure id="A4.F14" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.F14.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="243.63" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 243.63" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,243.63) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.74 L 0 236.89 C 0 240.61 3.02 243.63 6.74 243.63 L 543.26 243.63 C 546.98 243.63 550 240.61 550 236.89 L 550 6.74 C 550 3.02 546.98 0 543.26 0 L 6.74 0 C 3.02 0 0 3.02 0 6.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7FFF7;" fill="#F7FFF7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 6.74 L 0.83 220.26 L 549.17 220.26 L 549.17 6.74 C 549.17 3.47 546.53 0.83 543.26 0.83 L 6.74 0.83 C 3.47 0.83 0.83 3.47 0.83 6.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 228.48)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="445.97"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F14.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.23em;">
<span id="A4.F14.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F14.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Gemini-3-Flash (Success Case)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 21.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.06em;--ltx-fo-height:13.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="183.88" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 181.19)" width="512.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F14.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.06em;">
<span id="A4.F14.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F14.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Which cup contains the ball at the end of the video? 
<br class="ltx_break">(A) Left 
<br class="ltx_break">(B) Middle 
<br class="ltx_break">(C) Right 
<br class="ltx_break">Output your final answer (A, B, or C) in the format: <math id="A4.F14.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A4.F14.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F14.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The video begins with three cups and a red ball. The red ball is positioned on the right side. At the start of the video, the right cup is lowered to cover the ball. No shuffling or additional movements of the cups take place throughout the rest of the video. Therefore, the ball remains under the right cup. <math id="A4.F14.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.F14.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="1265.26" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 1265.26" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1265.26) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.74 L 0 1258.52 C 0 1262.24 3.02 1265.26 6.74 1265.26 L 543.26 1265.26 C 546.98 1265.26 550 1262.24 550 1258.52 L 550 6.74 C 550 3.02 546.98 0 543.26 0 L 6.74 0 C 3.02 0 0 3.02 0 6.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFAFA;" fill="#FFFAFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 6.74 L 0.83 1241.89 L 549.17 1241.89 L 549.17 6.74 C 549.17 3.47 546.53 0.83 543.26 0.83 L 6.74 0.83 C 3.47 0.83 0.83 3.47 0.83 6.74 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 1250.11)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="445.97"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F14.pic2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.23em;">
<span id="A4.F14.pic2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F14.pic2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Gemini-3-Flash (Hallucination)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.6 21.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.06em;--ltx-fo-height:86.93em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="1205.52" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 1202.83)" width="512.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F14.pic2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.06em;">
<span id="A4.F14.pic2.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F14.pic2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Which cup contains the ball at the end of the video? 
<br class="ltx_break">(A) Left 
<br class="ltx_break">(B) Middle 
<br class="ltx_break">(C) Right 
<br class="ltx_break">Output your final answer (A, B, or C) in the format: <math id="A4.F14.pic2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A4.F14.pic2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F14.pic2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">To find the location of the ball, we need to carefully track the movements of the cups throughout the video:</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Start (00:00 - 00:01):</span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> The ball is placed under the </span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Right</span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> cup.
</span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Swap 1 (00:02):</span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> The </span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup and the </span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Right</span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup swap positions. The ball is now in the </span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> position.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Swap 2 (00:03):</span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> The </span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Left</span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup and the </span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup swap positions. The ball is now in the </span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Left</span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> position.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Swap 3 (00:04):</span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> The </span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup and the </span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Right</span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup swap positions. The ball remains in the </span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Left</span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> position.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Swap 4 (00:05):</span><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> The </span><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Left</span><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup and the </span><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup swap positions. The ball is now in the </span><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> position.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">6.</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Swap 5 (00:06):</span><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> The </span><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup and the </span><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Right</span><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup swap positions. The ball is now in the </span><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Right</span><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> position.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">7.</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Swap 6 (00:07):</span><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> The </span><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Left</span><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup and the </span><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup swap positions. The ball remains in the </span><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Right</span><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> position.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">8.</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Swap 7 (00:08):</span><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> The </span><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup and the </span><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Right</span><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> cup swap positions. The ball is now in the </span><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Middle</span><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> position.
</span><span id="A4.I1.i8.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.F14.pic2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F14.pic2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At the end of the video, the ball is under the cup in the middle position. <math id="A4.F14.pic2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>Examples of hallucination by Gemini-3-Flash in zero-swap cases. Gemini-3-Pro and Gemini-3-Flash often correctly identify the initial state but then hallucinate a long sequence of non-existent swaps (as shown in <span id="A4.F14.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span>), causing the final prediction to be incorrect.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
