<br class="ltx_break">(A) Left 
<br class="ltx_break">(B) Middle 
<br class="ltx_break">(C) Right 
<br class="ltx_break">Output your final answer (A, B, or C) in the format: <math id="A5.F15.pic2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{&lt;option&gt;}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A5.F15.pic2.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F15.pic2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">(A) Left<span id="A5.F15.pic2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>Examples of Molmo2’s prompts and responses on VET-Bench. Molmo2 responds in a direct-answer mode without explicitly performing spatiotemporal tracking, resulting in near-random performance.</figcaption>
</figure>
