<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 17: </span>Examples of Molmo2-SGCoT failure cases. Errors typically arise in SGCoT when the model fails to differentiate between visually identical objects. This manifests as abrupt “jumps” in the spatial (top) or temporal (bottom) domains (highlighted in <span id="A5.F17.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span>), leading to incorrect terminal locations and subsequent failures in the final answer.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Training</h2>

<figure id="A6.T2" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A6.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A6.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Base Model</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">Molmo2-8B</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Training Method</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">QLoRA</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Gradient Accumulation Steps</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Batch Size</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">64</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Learning Rate</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1e-4</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Training Samples</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">300</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Number of Epochs</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" colspan="2"><span id="A6.T2.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LoRA Configuration</span></th></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">LoRA Rank (<math id="A6.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">16</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T2.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T2.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">LoRA Alpha (<math id="A6.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A6.T2.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">16</td></tr>
